     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Hi, </p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">I&#39;m new to R and the mailling list (and I apologise in advance if this sort of question is too open)</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">Is it possible to reproduce the following chart with R, perhaps with a combination of ggvis and other packages?</span><br></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><a href=\"http://www.causabrasil.com.br/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(74,107,130);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.causabrasil.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370351430000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Qeb0AmE1mM9Zv7joU5XGB\">http://www.causabrasil.com.br/</a></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:17.804800033569336px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Note how bubbles are somewhat &quot;floating around&quot;, they change smootly when the time slider is moved, and the largest ball gets attracted to the center.</p><div><span style=\"line-height:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif\">I s</span>earched<span style=\"line-height:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif\"> a lot on this topic but could not find anything </span>usefull<span style=\"line-height:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif\">. </span><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Liberation Sans, DejaVu Sans, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:18px\">tks in advance</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Liberation Sans, DejaVu Sans, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:18px\">Lucas</span></font></div><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><br></p></div>"
